Maintainer: FxSound Linux port <noreply@fxsound-linux.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/tasin-py/FXSounds-Linux
Description: FxSound audio enhancer for Linux (PipeWire)
 FxSound improves the sound of everything you play: 10-band equalizer,
 clarity, ambience, surround, dynamic boost and bass boost, with the
 presets of the Windows app. It adds an "FxSound" output device to
 PipeWire and plays the enhanced sound on your speakers or headphones.
 .
 This is the Linux port of the open-source FxSound app (AGPL-3.0).
